Third-party licences
====================

boostr-audio's own code is Apache-2.0 (see ../../LICENSE). This file covers
what boostr-audio redistributes but did not write. Each entry's licence text
and NOTICE travel beside the data it covers; this file is the index.

  path                  what                               source                     licence
  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  assets/misaki/        US and GB English G2P lexicons,     hexgrad/misaki 0.9.4       Apache-2.0
                        and the port in src/g2p/misaki/
                        (feature `misaki`)
  assets/spacy_en/      en_core_web_sm tokenizer patterns,  spaCy 3.8,                 MIT
                        exceptions and norm tables, and     en_core_web_sm 3.8.0
                        the port in src/g2p/spacy_tokenizer/
                        (feature `spacy-tokenizer`)
  assets/spacy_en/      en_core_web_sm tok2vec + tagger     spaCy 3.8, thinc 8.3,      MIT
                        weights and metadata, and the       en_core_web_sm 3.8.0
                        ports in src/g2p/spacy_tagger/ and
                        boostr's model/text/spacy_tagger/
                        (feature `spacy-tagger`)

The lexicons are embedded in the binary only when the `misaki` feature is on.
The spaCy tokenizer data is embedded only when the `spacy-tokenizer` feature
is on. The tagger weights (5.8 MB) are embedded only when the `spacy-tagger`
feature is on. `misaki` turns both on.
